An unpriced commodity included at the later endpoint prevents calculation.

========== API ==========

investmentPerformance({ accounts: ['Assets:Portfolio'], from: '2024-01-03', to: '2024-01-04' })

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  default
commodity FUND
commodity OTHER
P 2024-01-02 FUND 10 SEK
P 2024-01-03 FUND 12 SEK

2024-01-01 Acquisition before prices are available
  Assets:Portfolio  10 FUND
  Equity:Opening  -10 FUND

2024-01-04 Future acquisition without conversion prices
  Assets:Portfolio  1 FUND
  Assets:Portfolio  -1 OTHER

========== ERROR ==========

No price for OTHER on or before 2024-01-04 can convert it to SEK
